{{factionThroneEcho}}

The wound does **not seem** resolved. The throne opened a fork in the **axis**: above, air of strange harvest and ice on the **Heights**; below, hot stone where the earth still has a name.

You can **climb** and see how the world fared up there — or **descend** deeper. Both sides collect.
